OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe odd
OL,6,Fshower is possible in the north this
OL,7,Fevening, but most places will stay dry
OL,8,Fwith increasingly prolonged clear
OL,9,Fperiods overnight. Windy this evening
OL,10,Fbut winds easing overnight, and
OL,11,Fturning rather cool in some rural
OL,12,Fspots.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAny showers in the north
OL,15,Fsoon clearing. Thereafter a dry day
OL,16,Fwith sunny periods. Still a little
OL,17,Fbreezy but much less windy than on
OL,18,FFriday. Warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
